      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Clashing with a fish starts the catching sequence.  \n\r\nTo successfully
        catch the fish, you must fill up the fish bar, and if the fish bar depletes,
        the fish escapes!\n\nWhen a fish goes in a direction, you must HOLD the button(s)
        of the opposite direction to tire the fish out. Holding none or any other
        buttons will make the meter go down. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
