      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Interacting with a fish tank brings up the fish inventory. \n\nFrom
        the fish inventory, you can deposit the caught fish into the tank. \n\nSimply
        drag a fish in or out of the fish inventory to manage your fish. \n\nIf you
        leave fish in the fish inventory before starting a dive, it will release
        the fish in the fish inventory back into the ocean. \n\nSo make sure to put
        the fish you want to keep in a tank before starting a dive. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
